@startuml memory-injection-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Arial"
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #78909C
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor #E3F2FD

title 心屿 — Agent 调用时三层记忆注入序列

participant "Java Core" as JavaCore
participant "AI Agent\n(LangGraph)" as Agent
participant "MCP ShortChat\ngetAppShortChatMessage" as MCPShort
participant "MCP Memory\ngetUserProfile" as MCPMem
participant "PostgreSQL\n(短期记忆)" as PG
participant "PolarDB\n(长期记忆+画像)" as PolarDB
participant "LLM\nqwen3-max" as LLM

JavaCore -> Agent : POST /openai/v1/chat/completions\n{userId, characterId, saveId\nrecentShortChatMessages? longTermMemory? userProfile?}

note over Agent : validate params Node\n解析 Pydantic 模型

Agent -> MCPShort : getAppShortChatMessage\n{userId, characterId, batchSize=40}
MCPShort -> PG : SELECT last 40 rounds
PG --> MCPShort : messages[]
MCPShort --> Agent : 短期记忆 [{senderType, content}, ...]

Agent -> MCPMem : getUserProfile\n{userId, roleId, saveId}
MCPMem -> PolarDB : HTTP GET /profiles
PolarDB --> MCPMem : {nickname, profile}
MCPMem --> Agent : 用户画像 {nickname, profile}

note over Agent
  long term memory 来源：
  · 熟人Feed: Java Core 打包传入
  · 星梦/短聊: MCP 查询向量库
end note

Agent -> Agent : 构建 XML 结构化提示词\n<角色设定> ... </角色设定>\n<用户画像> nickname + profile </用户画像>\n<双方记忆>\n  <近期对话摘要> 40轮 </近期对话摘要>\n  <长期记忆> PolarDB事实 </长期记忆>\n</双方记忆>

Agent -> LLM : messages[system + user]\ntemperature=0.9
LLM --> Agent : 生成回复

Agent -> Agent : 输出解析\n移除 think 块 / 提取 JSON / json repair

Agent --> JavaCore : choices[0].message.content

note over JavaCore
  异步后处理：
  ① 轮次计数 +1 via RocketMQ
  ② 达到 30 轮 → SummaryReadyEvent
  ③ memory-service → PolarDB 写入
end note

@enduml
